('PI-ING-000294','wpc_60_percent','WHEY PROTEIN CONCENTRATE · WPC 60 · 60% PROTEIN','Standard','Standard','General','','dairy','whey_protein_concentrate','TRUE','TRUE','Estimated / PI Calculated','GC20 GLOBAL REFERENCE + EXPLICIT MODEL: USDEC_COMP, WPC80','2026-09-07','84','4','96','6','3.84','6','90','60','60','24','24','0','0','0','0','24','0','0','0.3','0','6','','','96','3.84','25.755','','0.0384','0.25755','0','','','390','12','EUR','milk','FALSE','FALSE','TRUE','FALSE','ambient_dry','180','Used as a dairy component for body, fat balance, milk solids and clean gelato texture. | GC20 neutral food-ingredient reference, not a flavoured retail blend or lot certificate. Per100g powder; carbohydrates exclude fibre; salt is sodium-equivalent and is not added a second time to ash. Detailed sugar distribution, moisture/minerals and any unsourced minor values are explicit estimates. 100 ml=100 g owner convention preserved where relevant. Contains the named inherent allergen; lactose content does not remove milk protein allergy. Neutral WPC60 composition rebalanced by reference interpolation; old ash0 and lactose POD coefficient0.55 not propagated. Not a branded TDS.','DATA-APPROVED reference; Engine/Rescue code and runtime not changed or tested. POD/PAC use existing Gellatti carbohydrate and salt coefficients. aerating_protein_percent is a composition proxy, not a measured foam fraction/overrun. stabilizer_activity=0 means no separately dosed hydrocolloid, not no protein structuring. Intact-protein colligative contribution omitted under existing Mapper convention; hydration, aggregation and texture remain grade/process dependent. Exact PR facts and product-specific functional data override reference estimates. Neutral WPC60 composition rebalanced by reference interpolation; old ash0 and lactose POD coefficient0.55 not propagated. Not a branded TDS.','https://www.thinkusadairy.org/assets/documents/Customer%20Site/C3-Using%20Dairy/C3.7-Resources%20and%20Insights/03-Application%20and%20Technical%20Materials/CleanLabel_TechReport_FINAL.pdf | https://www.thinkusadairy.org/products/whey-protein-and-ingredients/whey-categories/wpc-80','General','Gellatti · GC20 Protein source and composition audit','2026-09-07'),
