('PI-ING-001494','quinces','QUINCES · Fresh Fruit','','','General','','fruit','fresh_fruit_profile','TRUE','TRUE','Estimated / PI Calculated','GC40: Leonel et al. 2016, Table3, ten cultivars + explicit Mapper closure','2026-09-07','76','83.55','16.45','0.1','0.02','0','0','0.4','0','13.4','10.33','1.5495','0','3.6155','5.165','0','0','1.9','0.01','0','0.65','','','16.45','13.1139','18.2909','','0.131139','0.182909','','','','60','','EUR','none_declared','TRUE','TRUE','TRUE','FALSE','ambient','','Auto-imported from confirmed screenshot batch (Q0236). Label: quinces. No separate ingredient list shown in screenshot; treated as single-ingredient reference profile. | GC40: S/G/F normalized from sum1.0000 to total10.33; trace sugars/rounding included in proxy, not exact assays. Saturated fat0.02 is a modelling estimate; source cell was blank. Sugar10.33 is arithmetic mean of ten cultivar means9.5–11.1, not a world mean. S/G/F15/35/50 is explicitly estimated, not measured in that table. Macros retained from old global; ash is a reference estimate; water by balance; saturated fat estimated at20% of fat. Acid/Brix are not transferred from juice. SOURCE METHODS DIFFER; not analytical precision.','GC40 fruit reference correction. Zero sugar replaced with a documented reference/model. Research total + explicitly estimated/proxy spectrum. POD/PAC calculated with current Mapper coefficients; acids/polyol trace contributions are not separately resolved. S/G/F normalized from sum1.0000 to total10.33; trace sugars/rounding included in proxy, not exact assays. Saturated fat0.02 is a modelling estimate; source cell was blank. Sugar10.33 is arithmetic mean of ten cultivar means9.5–11.1, not a world mean. S/G/F15/35/50 is explicitly estimated, not measured in that table. Macros retained from old global; ash is a reference estimate; water by balance; saturated fat estimated at20% of fat. Acid/Brix are not transferred from juice. SOURCE METHODS DIFFER; not analytical precision.','https://www.cropj.com/leonel_10_5_2016_711_716.pdf','Zrzut ekranu 2026-07-7 o 01.23.29.png; Q0236; mapper_screenshots_batch_2026-07-07_0122-0125_natural_misc','Gellatti · GC40 Fruit data audit','2026-09-07'),
