('PI-ING-001507','sapodilla','SAPODILLA · Fresh Fruit','','','General','','fruit','tropical_fruit_profile','TRUE','TRUE','Estimated / PI Calculated','GC40: Monteiro et al.2020, DOI10.33448/rsd-v9i9.7425 + explicit Mapper closure','2026-09-07','76','78','22','1.1','0.22','0','0','0.4','0','14.7','12.38','1.55','0','5.98','4.85','0','0','5.3','0.03','0','0.5','','','22','14.3996','22.3025','','0.143996','0.223025','','','','81','','EUR','none_declared','TRUE','TRUE','TRUE','FALSE','ambient','','Auto-imported from confirmed screenshot batch (Q0279). Label: sapodilla. No separate ingredient list shown in screenshot; treated as single-ingredient reference profile. | GC40: Saturated fat0.22 is a modelling estimate; source cell was blank. Total12.38 from colorimetric method; HPLC G5.98/F4.85. S1.55 is mass-balance proxy, close to nonreducing assay1.57, not measured sucrose. Paper HPLC printed total has arithmetic inconsistency; not copied. Macros retained from old global; ash is a reference estimate; water by balance; saturated fat estimated at20% of fat. Acid/Brix are not transferred from juice. SOURCE METHODS DIFFER; not analytical precision.','GC40 fruit reference correction. Zero sugar replaced with a documented reference/model. Research total + explicitly estimated/proxy spectrum. POD/PAC calculated with current Mapper coefficients; acids/polyol trace contributions are not separately resolved. Saturated fat0.22 is a modelling estimate; source cell was blank. Total12.38 from colorimetric method; HPLC G5.98/F4.85. S1.55 is mass-balance proxy, close to nonreducing assay1.57, not measured sucrose. Paper HPLC printed total has arithmetic inconsistency; not copied. Macros retained from old global; ash is a reference estimate; water by balance; saturated fat estimated at20% of fat. Acid/Brix are not transferred from juice. SOURCE METHODS DIFFER; not analytical precision.','https://www.researchgate.net/publication/344010269_Caracterizacao_fisico-quimica_e_perfil_de_acucares_da_polpa_de_sapoti_Manilkara_sapota_L','Zrzut ekranu 2026-07-7 o 01.25.03.png; Q0279; mapper_screenshots_batch_2026-07-07_0122-0125_natural_misc','Gellatti · GC40 Fruit data audit','2026-09-07'),
