('PI-ING-002181','global_lactose_free_milk_0_1_fat_pasteurized_uht','LACTOSE-FREE MILK · 0.1% FAT · Pasteurized/UHT','Standard','Standard','General','','dairy','lactose_free_milk','TRUE','TRUE','Estimated / Owner-approved Engine model','GC11-12 GLOBAL REFERENCE: MILK, LF | OWNER_RULE_LF_GLUCOSE_2026-09-07','2026-09-07','85','90.5442','9.4558','0.1','0.064','0.1','9.3558','3.5344','3.5344','4.9898','4.9898','0','0','4.9798','0','0.01','0','0','0.1','0','0.8316','','','9.4558','3.836','10.0566','','0.03836','0.100566','0','','','35','','','milk','FALSE','FALSE','TRUE','FALSE','refrigerated','','GLOBAL, brand-neutral; not an exact SKU. Hydrolysed-lactose reference at specified milk fat; equal glucose/galactose mass model; lactose.01 is reference not assay. Saturated fat modelled from family fraction. Owner convention: 100 ml = 100 g; no density adjustment. This is a reference profile, not a statistical world average. Allergens describe the defined ingredient; no unsupported brand-specific trace claims. Confidence is an editorial evidence score, not a statistical probability or certification. | OWNER RULE 2026-09-07: in lactose-free dairy, glucose + galactose created by lactose hydrolysis are intentionally collapsed into glucose_percent. Galactose is not modelled separately. Residual lactose stays in lactose_percent. This approximation is accepted for Gellatti Engine/Rescue.','GC11-12 dairy data model. OWNER RULE 2026-09-07: in lactose-free dairy, glucose + galactose created by lactose hydrolysis are intentionally collapsed into glucose_percent. Galactose is not modelled separately. Residual lactose stays in lactose_percent. This approximation is accepted for Gellatti Engine/Rescue. total_sugars_percent is unchanged; glucose_percent stores the effective hydrolysed monosaccharide pool; POD is recalculated with the Mapper glucose coefficient; PAC is retained because glucose and galactose have effectively the same colligative molar contribution. Owner convention 100 ml = 100 g remains in force. Exact product facts take precedence.','https://dairyprocessinghandbook.tetrapak.com/chapter/chemistry-milk | https://www.valio.com/articles/valio-eila-lactose-free-ingredients-for-the-food-and-dairy-industries/','','Gellatti owner rule + GPT-5.6 Sol','2026-09-07'),
