('PI-ING-002246','global_lactose_free_milk_powder_0_6_fat_37_protein_hydrolysed','LACTOSE-FREE MILK POWDER · 0.6% FAT · 37% PROTEIN · HYDROLYSED','Standard','Standard','General','','dairy','lactose_free_milk_powder','TRUE','TRUE','Estimated / Owner-approved Engine model','GC11-12 GLOBAL REFERENCE: LF, SMP, LEGACY | OWNER_RULE_LF_GLUCOSE_2026-09-07','2026-09-07','80','1.6','98.4','0.6','0.384','0.6','97.8','37','37','52.4','52.4','0','0','52.35','0','0.05','0','0','1','0','8.4','','','98.4','40.3175','105.365','','0.403175','1.05365','0','','','363','','','milk','FALSE','FALSE','TRUE','FALSE','ambient_dry','','GLOBAL, brand-neutral; not an exact SKU. Neutral class seeded from existingPI-ING-000283 macro profile; no claim of exact current Valio TDS. Glucose/galactose split is a bounded equal-mass model; accurate totals retained. Saturated fat modelled from family fraction. Owner convention: 100 ml = 100 g; no density adjustment. This is a reference profile, not a statistical world average. Allergens describe the defined ingredient; no unsupported brand-specific trace claims. Confidence is an editorial evidence score, not a statistical probability or certification. | OWNER RULE 2026-09-07: in lactose-free dairy, glucose + galactose created by lactose hydrolysis are intentionally collapsed into glucose_percent. Galactose is not modelled separately. Residual lactose stays in lactose_percent. This approximation is accepted for Gellatti Engine/Rescue.','GC11-12 dairy data model. OWNER RULE 2026-09-07: in lactose-free dairy, glucose + galactose created by lactose hydrolysis are intentionally collapsed into glucose_percent. Galactose is not modelled separately. Residual lactose stays in lactose_percent. This approximation is accepted for Gellatti Engine/Rescue. total_sugars_percent is unchanged; glucose_percent stores the effective hydrolysed monosaccharide pool; POD is recalculated with the Mapper glucose coefficient; PAC is retained because glucose and galactose have effectively the same colligative molar contribution. Owner convention 100 ml = 100 g remains in force. Exact product facts take precedence. Powder process/hydration remains grade-dependent; Engine eligibility does not imply unconditional cold-process production.','https://www.valio.com/articles/valio-eila-lactose-free-ingredients-for-the-food-and-dairy-industries/ | https://www.thinkusadairy.org/products/milk-powders/milk-powder-categories/non-fat-dry-milk-and-skim-milk-powder | local:gc10/mapper_basement.csv','','Gellatti owner rule + GPT-5.6 Sol','2026-09-07'),
