('PI-ING-002268','global_wpc_34_35','WHEY PROTEIN CONCENTRATE · WPC 34/35 · 35% PROTEIN','Standard','Standard','General','','dairy','whey_protein_concentrate','TRUE','TRUE','Estimated / PI Calculated','GC20 GLOBAL REFERENCE + EXPLICIT MODEL: WPC34, USDEC_COMP','2026-09-07','90','4','96','4','2.56','4','92','35','35','49.5','49.5','0','0','0','0','49.5','0','0','0.7','0','7.5','','','96','7.92','53.595','','0.0792','0.53595','0','','','374','','','milk','FALSE','FALSE','TRUE','FALSE','ambient_dry','','GC20 neutral food-ingredient reference, not a flavoured retail blend or lot certificate. Per100g powder; carbohydrates exclude fibre; salt is sodium-equivalent and is not added a second time to ash. Detailed sugar distribution, moisture/minerals and any unsourced minor values are explicit estimates. 100 ml=100 g owner convention preserved where relevant. Contains the named inherent allergen; lactose content does not remove milk protein allergy. 35P/4F/49.5 lactose/7.5 ash/4 moisture is a coherent centre within WPC34-class ranges.','DATA-APPROVED reference; Engine/Rescue code and runtime not changed or tested. POD/PAC use existing Gellatti carbohydrate and salt coefficients. aerating_protein_percent is a composition proxy, not a measured foam fraction/overrun. stabilizer_activity=0 means no separately dosed hydrocolloid, not no protein structuring. Intact-protein colligative contribution omitted under existing Mapper convention; hydration, aggregation and texture remain grade/process dependent. Exact PR facts and product-specific functional data override reference estimates. 35P/4F/49.5 lactose/7.5 ash/4 moisture is a coherent centre within WPC34-class ranges.','https://www.thinkusadairy.org/products/whey-protein-and-ingredients/whey-categories/wpc-34 | https://www.thinkusadairy.org/assets/documents/Customer%20Site/C3-Using%20Dairy/C3.7-Resources%20and%20Insights/03-Application%20and%20Technical%20Materials/CleanLabel_TechReport_FINAL.pdf','','Gellatti · GC20 Protein source and composition audit','2026-09-07'),
