('PI-ING-002306','global_vanilla_extract_35abv_no_added_sugar','VANILLA EXTRACT · 35% VOL · NO ADDED SUGAR','Standard','Standard','General','','flavor_concentrate','vanilla_extract','TRUE','TRUE','Estimated / PI Calculated','GC30: defined global reference + disclosed models; R35, RNO, NMORG, ECFR','2026-09-07','87','69.885','2.5','0.38','0.18','0','0','0.13','0','1.7','1.7','1.7','0','0','0','0','0','0.19','0.038625','27.615','0.1','','','2.5','1.7','206.276956','','0.017','2.06276956','0','','','204.425','','','none_declared','TRUE','TRUE','TRUE','TRUE','ambient','','GC30 GLOBAL PROFILE. No-added-sugar alcoholic extract family. Low macronutrients use historical NM organic reference; 35% ABV anchored to current Rodelle family and US extract standard. Global reference, not statistical market average. ALLERGEN SCOPE: none_declared refers only to this defined neutral composition (vanilla/specified carrier). Not a guarantee of absence of cross-contact in a commercial product; exact PR label and manufacturer warnings remain authoritative. Do not inherit one brand''s facility warnings to every global profile.','DATA-ONLY PROFILE; no runtime test. Owner convention100ml=100g, no solution-density correction. POD/PAC cover sugars, glycerol and ethanol where present. ABV uses existing Mapper ethanol unit conversion0.789g/ml; water+dry solids+ethanol=100. Salt is included in ash, not added to mass twice. Aroma strength is not sugar POD; spoon-for-spoon flavour equivalence is not mass/texture equivalence. NM organic sheet reports 377 g beans/L; therefore no 1-fold/2-fold claim is made for this neutral profile. Native sugar spectrum is sucrose-equivalent estimate. Source kcal236 is not adopted: energy is recalculated for the accepted Mapper alcohol conversion. Ash0.10 and water are modelled, not measured.','https://www.rodellekitchen.com/business-solutions/industrial-offerings/ | https://www.rodellekitchen.com/products/tanzania-pure-vanilla-extract/ | https://www.natuurlijknatuur