('PI-ING-002311','global_vanilla_bean_paste_alcohol_rich','VANILLA BEAN PASTE · ~38% SUGARS · ~14% ETHANOL','Standard','Standard','General','','flavor_paste','vanilla_paste','TRUE','TRUE','Estimated / PI Calculated','GC30: defined global reference + disclosed models; LPA, LWEB','2026-09-07','86','43.5','42.12','0.22','0.03','0','0','0.27','0','38.78','38.29','38.29','0','0','0','0','0','2.72','0.022275','14.38','0.13','','','42.12','38.29','144.832309','','0.3829','1.44832309','0','','','265.12','','','none_declared','TRUE','TRUE','TRUE','TRUE','ambient','','GC30 GLOBAL PROFILE. LorAnn3003 2022 calculated reference (manufacturer explicitly says not analytical). US carbs41.50 less fibre2.72=38.78 Mapper carbs; alcohol14.38g/100g supplied directly. ALLERGEN SCOPE: none_declared refers only to this defined neutral composition (vanilla/specified carrier). Not a guarantee of absence of cross-contact in a commercial product; exact PR label and manufacturer warnings remain authoritative. Do not inherit one brand''s facility warnings to every global profile.','DATA-ONLY PROFILE; no runtime test. Owner convention100ml=100g, no solution-density correction. POD/PAC cover sugars, glycerol and ethanol where present. ABV uses existing Mapper ethanol unit conversion0.789g/ml; water+dry solids+ethanol=100. Salt is included in ash, not added to mass twice. Aroma strength is not sugar POD; spoon-for-spoon flavour equivalence is not mass/texture equivalence. Sheet lists water40.62 yet explicit fractions leave a 2.88g mass gap. Neutral model water is residual43.50, not reported40.62. Kcal265.12 retained as manufacturer reference. Not a claim every vanilla paste contains14% ethanol.','https://www.webstaurantstore.com/documents/nutrition/3003_vanilla_bean_paste_natural_np_regal.pdf | https://www.lorannoils.com/products/vanilla-bean-paste-natural','','Gellatti · GC30 Vanilla reference audit','2026-09-07'),
('PI-ING-002312','global_ground_vanilla_whole_pod','GROUND VANILLA · 100% WHOLE BEAN / POD','Standard','Standard','General','','spice','ground_vanilla','TRUE','TRUE','Estimated / PI Calculated','GC30: defined global reference + disclosed models; PV, RP, DM','2026-09-07','83','14.6','85.4','3.2','0.8','0','0','3.8','0','53.2','47','47','0','0','0','0','0','22.2','0','0','3','','','85.4','47','47','','0.47','0.47','0','','','302','','','none_declared','TRUE','TRUE','TRUE','FALSE','ambient_dry','','GC30 GLOBAL PROFILE. Whole ground bean, no sugar/carrier added. PureVanilla PV70025ORG2021 reference macros; assumed ash3 gives moisture14.6%, inside its10–15% range. Sugar47 modelled as sucrose-equivalent. ALLERGEN SCOPE: none_declared refers only to this defined neutral composition (vanilla/specified carrier). Not a guarantee of absence of cross-contact in a commercial product; exact PR label and manufacturer warnings remain authoritative. Do not inherit one brand''s facility warnings to every global profile.','DATA-ONLY PROFILE; no runtime test. Owner convention100ml=100g, no solution-density correction. POD/PAC cover sugars, glycerol and ethanol where present. ABV uses existing Mapper ethanol unit conversion0.789g/ml; water+dry solids+ethanol=100. Salt is included in ash, not added to mass twice. Aroma strength is not sugar POD; spoon-for-spoon flavour equivalence is not mass/texture equivalence. Reference labels disagree strongly on sugars (dm8, PureVanilla47, Rapunzel55.4g/100g). Do not present47 as a measured worldwide mean; sensitivity at low dose is documented. This is not the MD-carrier powder. Batch safety/infusion authority not inferred from nutrition.','https://www.12taste.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/Productspecification-PV70025ORG.pdf | https://shop.rapunzel.de/1460370/Vanillepulver-Bourbon/ | https://www.dm.de/p/d/1461618/dmbio-bourbon-vanille-gemahlen','','Gellatti · GC30 Vanilla reference audit','2026-09-07'),
('PI-ING-002313','global_vanilla_powder_maltodextrin_carrier','VANILLA FLAVOUR POWDER · MALTODEXTRIN CARRIER','Standard','Standard','General','','flavor_powder','vanilla_extract_powder','TRUE','TRUE','Estimated / PI Calculated','GC30: defined global reference + disclosed models; NP, NPL, NPI','2026-09-07','80','4.2','95.8','0','0','0','0','0','0','95.5','3','0','0','3','0','0','0','0','0.25','0','0.3','','','95.8','11.057895','19.657763','','0.11057895','0.19657763','0','','','382','','','none_declared','TRUE','TRUE','TRUE','FALSE','ambient_dry','','GC30 GLOBAL PROFILE. NM ingredient statement: maltodextrin from corn plus vanilla extractives. Neutral model95.5g carbs,3g glucose,ash0.3,water4.2; carrier behaviour prior PI-ING-002121 (DE9–11), not an actual NM DE specification. ALLERGEN SCOPE: none_declared refers only to this defined neutral composition (vanilla/specified carrier). Not a guarantee of absence of cross-contact in a commercial product; exact PR label and manufacturer warnings remain authoritative. Do not inherit one brand''s facility warnings to every global profile.','DATA-ONLY PROFILE; no runtime test. Owner convention100ml=100g, no solution-density correction. POD/PAC cover sugars, glycerol and ethanol where present. ABV uses existing Mapper ethanol unit conversion0.789g/ml; water+dry solids+ethanol=100. Salt is included in ash, not added to mass twice. Aroma strength is not sugar POD; spoon-for-spoon flavour equivalence is not mass/texture equivalence. Small-serving label rounding cannot establish zero sugars or moisture; all concentration/DE/mono split values explicitly estimated. Manufacturer0g sugar per5ml is consistent with, but does not verify,3g/100g. Salt0.25 from5mg sodium/5ml under owner100ml=100g. No ground-bean profile substitution.','https://nielsenmassey.com/products/pure-vanilla-powder/ | https://www.webstaurantstore.com/documents/nutrition/nm_2.5_oz_vanilla_powder.pdf | https://www.webstaurantstore.com/documents/pdf/vanillapowder.pdf','','Gellatti · GC30 Vanilla reference audit','2026-09-07'),
('PI-ING-002314','global_natural_vanilla_sugar_whole_cane','VANILLA SUGAR · NATURAL · WHOLE-CANE BASE','Standard','Standard','General','','sweetener','natural_vanilla_sugar','TRUE','TRUE','Estimated / PI Calculated','GC30: defined global reference + disclosed models; NS','2026-09-07','90','5','95','0.2','0.1','0','0','0.2','0','92.6','92.5','92.5','0','0','0','0','0','1.5','0.01','0','0.5','','','95','92.5','92.5585','','0.925','0.925585','0','','','376','','','none_declared','TRUE','TRUE','TRUE','FALSE','ambient_dry','','GC30 GLOBAL PROFILE. Reference: whole cane sugar plus6.25% natural ground vanilla; Rapunzel declared macros. Sugar spectrum approximated by sucrose. Not vanilla flavour intensity standard. ALLERGEN SCOPE: none_declared refers only to this defined neutral composition (vanilla/specified carrier). Not a guarantee of absence of cross-contact in a commercial product; exact PR label and manufacturer warnings remain authoritative. Do not inherit one brand''s facility warnings to every global profile.','DATA-ONLY PROFILE; no runtime test. Owner convention100ml=100g, no solution-density correction. POD/PAC cover sugars, glycerol and ethanol where present. ABV uses existing Mapper ethanol unit conversion0.789g/ml; water+dry solids+ethanol=100. Salt is included in ash, not added to mass twice. Aroma strength is not sugar POD; spoon-for-spoon flavour equivalence is not mass/texture equivalence. Ash0.5 and water5.0 by balance estimated; no claim every vanilla sugar has6.25%vanilla. Different from existing PI-ING-000516 VANILLA SUGAR. Retail traces are product-specific.','https://shop.rapunzel.de/1460660/Vanillezucker-Bourbon-mit-Rapadura/','','Gellatti · GC30 Vanilla reference audit','2026-09-07'),
