('PI-ING-002365','global_gc41_apple_juice_s11_760000000000002','APPLE JUICE · Unsweetened · Liquid','Standard','Standard','General','','fruit','fruit_juice','TRUE','TRUE','Estimated / PI Calculated','USDA SR28 NDB09016 | GC41 disclosed reference model','2026-09-07','88','88.24','11.76','0.13','0.022','0','0','0.1','0','11.1','9.62','1.26','0','2.63','5.73','0','0','0.2','0.01','0','0.23','','','11.76','13.0261','17.2025','','0.130261','0.172025','0','','','46','','','none_declared','TRUE','TRUE','TRUE','FALSE','refrigerated','','GLOBAL REFERENCE, not a statistically sampled worldwide mean or a specific SKU. Exact PR label facts override reference estimates. Owner convention100ml=100g, no density correction. Allergen field describes the defined global recipe, not cross-contact of every factory. Unsweetened juice reference; not nectar/syrup. Pasteurization of an actual product must be checked. Fruit acidity is not added to the existing sugar/salt PAC approximation. ','GC41 DATA MODEL: apple_juice; scale=1.00000000; target_solids=11.7600. Reference normalization: available-carbohydrate adjustment=0.0000 g/100g; source-water delta=0.0; water balance excludes double-counting salt. S/G/F ratios normalized to total sugars; ratios derived from related fruit forms are expressly estimates. Unassayed minor polyols/other sugars are not separately quantified. POD/PAC use existing sucrose1.0/glucose0.77/fructose1.70 and freezing1.0/1.90/salt5.85 conventions. PAC omits unquantified organic-acid and other-solute contributions; it is not a measured freezing curve. Fibre is outside available carbohydrates. No application/importer/Engine/Rescue execution.','https://www.ars.usda.gov/ARSUserFiles/80400535/Data/SR/SR28/reports/sr28fg09.pdf#page=13','','Gellatti · GC41 Fruit forms data audit','2026-09-07'),
