('PI-ING-002396','global_almond_blanch_almond_blanch_kernel_gc50','ALMONDS · Blanched Kernels · Unroasted','Standard','Standard','General','','nut','almond_blanch','TRUE','TRUE','Estimated / GC50 global reference','USDA/producer reference + pure model; sources and source-basis conversion in GC50 sheets','2026-09-08','93','4.5','95.5','52.52','3.953','0','0','21.4','0','8.77','4.63','4.6','0','0.03','0','0','0','9.9','0.0475','0','2.91','','','95.5','4.6231','4.93487','','0.046231','0.0493487','0','','','590','','','tree_nuts, tree_nuts_almond','TRUE','TRUE','TRUE','FALSE','ambient_dry','','Brand-neutral kernel profile.  Mass closure water 4.5, source water 4.51; adjustment -0.0100 g/100g. Effective sugar spectrum: measured glucose/fructose retained; trace galactose pooled to glucose; unrepresented disaccharides and analytical remainder pooled to sucrose-equivalent. Not a new analytical assay. Inherent ingredient allergens only; no SKU/pakownia cross-contact declaration is generalized. none_declared refers to the defined EU14/US9 ingredient scope, not all possible sensitivities.','GC50 data reference, not exact SKU/batch assay. USDA carbohydrate-by-difference includes fibre; Mapper available carbohydrate excludes fibre. Sodium mg converted to salt g by x0.0025. Salt is part of ash and is not added twice to mass. kcal retains the source''s food-specific conversion. Effective sugar split is a declared modelling approximation; minor unsupported species are not laboratory claims. POD/PAC follow current Mapper coefficients. No application/Engine/Rescue runtime tests. No stabilizer activity or aerating protein credit is inferred from protein content. Species/refinement/roast form must match; flour here is full-fat, not defatted protein powder.','https://www.ars.usda.gov/ARSUserFiles/80400535/Data/SR/SR28/reports/sr28fg12.pdf#page=21','','Gellatti · GC50 nuts and seeds reference audit','2026-09-08'),
