('PI-ING-002529','global_soy_lecithin_fluid','SOY LECITHIN · Fluid · No Added Carrier','Standard','Standard','General','','emulsifier','soy_lecithin_fluid','TRUE','TRUE','Estimated / PI Calculated','GC54 documented reference model: LEC_SOY_L,LEC_ALC','2026-09-08','90','0.3','99.7','72.1','13.8','0','0','0','0','3.7','2.1','2.1','0','0','0','0','0','0','0.0185','0','9.6','','','99.7','2.1','2.755899','','0.021','0.02755899','0','','','790','','','soy','TRUE','TRUE','TRUE','FALSE','ambient','','GLOBAL NEUTRAL REFERENCE; Phospholipid-rich fluid, not deoiled. Carrier: None added. Fluid oil-rich form; disperse in the fat phase. Warming can aid mixing; not a universal kill step. ADM composition reference. Trace protein approximated as 0; measured trace is not proof of absence of soy allergen. Non-TG organic dry fraction is explicit in the calculation sheet, not fabricated water or digestible carbohydrate. fat_percent retains nutritional TG-equivalent fat; total_solids_percent retains total material. A macro-only residual-water algorithm must not replace the stored moisture. Sugars use a sucrose-equivalent prior; uncharacterized small carbohydrate molecules use MW1000. Phospholipid aggregates are not treated as dissolved simple sugars. Allergen state describes the defined ingredient, not all brands or every manufacturing site. Source-specific precautionary labels remain product-specific; no blanket trace allergens inferred.','GC54 DATA-ONLY. Non-TG organic dry fraction is explicit in the calculation sheet, not fabricated water or digestible carbohydrate. fat_percent retains nutritional TG-equivalent fat; total_solids_percent retains total material. A macro-only residual-water algorithm must not replace the stored moisture. Sugars use a sucrose-equivalent prior; uncharacterized small carbohydrate molecules use MW1000. Phospholipid aggregates are not treated as dissolved simple sugars. Explicit modeled soluble-polymer pool=0g, MW=100000g/mol; non-sugar small-carbohydrate pool=1.6g, MW=1000g/mol. Unallocated organic dry matter=14.3g/100g, NOT water. NDC in carbohydrate field=0.0g/100g, energy2kcal/g. POD/PAC are reference calculations using existing coefficients, NOT measured freezing/rheological behavior. NaCl-equivalent PAC does not fully specify counterions, calcium gelation or protein interactions. stabilizer_activity is an existing role indicator, not a universal potency number. Approved for modelling; exact product facts/process take precedence. Owner100ml=100g retained. No runtime Engine/Rescue or production test.','https://ingredi.com/content/pdfs/11710-02_(YEL451)_Lecithin-Yelkin-TS_ADM_Dossier.pdf | https://americanlecithin.us/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/ALC-Lecithin-and-Phopholipids-Brochure.pdf','','Gellatti · GC54 reference-data audit','2026-09-08'),
