('PI-ING-002560','callebaut_ruby_rb1_chr_r36rb12_us_u75','CALLEBAUT RUBY RB1 · CHR-R36RB12-US-U75 · Couverture','Callebaut','Barry Callebaut','Belgium / US specification','5410522593914','chocolate','ruby_chocolate_couverture','TRUE','TRUE','Verified / Exact Product Specification / PI Calculated','Barry Callebaut CHR-R36RB12-US-U75 product specification dated 2021-06-15','2026-09-09','98','1','99','35.9','21.5','','','9.3','0','50.7','48','0','0','0','0','0','0','0.9','0.266954','0','2.15','','','99','48','49.561681','','0.48','0.49561681','0','','','548','','','milk, soy','FALSE','FALSE','TRUE','FALSE','ambient_dry','548','EXACT CALLEBAUT RUBY RB1 US code CHR-R36RB12-US-U75. Ruby couverture with the manufacturer''s ruby colour/taste profile; not white chocolate renamed. Use the exact regional code/label when a different RB1 pack is supplied.','GC70 ENGINE-APPROVED EXACT PRODUCT PROFILE for CHR-R36RB12-US-U75. The same product specification supplies EAN, moisture limit, fat, energy, protein, total carbohydrate, sugars, fibre, sodium, ash, allergens and shelf life. Mapper carbohydrate_percent is 51.6 total carbohydrate minus 0.9 fibre = 50.7 available carbohydrate. Salt is converted from 105.1 mg sodium using the existing 2.54 factor. Total sugars are used as sucrose-equivalent for POD/PAC because individual sugar species are not declared. Dry milk solids are stated commercially, but milk-fat/NFMS split is not assigned to avoid inventing an exact partition.','https://raderfoods.com/wp-content/uploads/Raderfoods.com_spec-sheet_callebaut_R36RB.pdf | https://www.callebaut.com/en/products/callebaut/rubychocolaterecipeRB1/CHR-R36RB12-CA-U75','','Gellatti · GC67–GC75 closure','2026-09-09'),
('PI-ING-002561','sosa_fruit_pectin_nh_58030000','FRUIT PECTIN NH · Sosa · 58030000 · Exact Product / Composition Required','Sosa Ingredients','Sosa Ingredients','Spain','','stabilizer','pectin_nh_sosa_58030000','FALSE','FALSE','Blocked / Exact Composition Required','Official Sosa Fruit Pectin NH technical sheet; active/carrier proportions not disclosed','2026-09-09','97','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','0','','','','','','','','','','','0.5','2','','','','none_declared','TRUE','TRUE','TRUE','FALSE','ambient_dry','','EXACT PRODUCT IDENTITY. Thermoreversible LMA fruit pectin preparation with salts and calcium for acidic, sugar-containing nappage/glaze systems. Typical dosage 0.5–2%. Not equivalent to carrier-free LMA pectin PI-ING-002536.','GC71 BLOCKED. The technical sheet identifies function and process but does not disclose the mass fraction of active pectin, sugar carrier, salts or calcium. A deterministic nutrition/POD/PAC/solids profile would therefore be fabricated. Keep Base/Engine FALSE until exact composition is available; use only as a manually specified commercial product.','https://www.lkstore.cz/user/documents/upload/fruit_pectin_nh_en.pdf','','Gellatti · GC67–GC75 closure','2026-09-09'),
('PI-ING-002562','hydroxypropyl_methylcellulose_hpmc_e464_grade_unspecified','HYDROXYPROPYL METHYLCELLULOSE (HPMC) · E464 · Grade Unspecified','Standard','Standard','General','','stabilizer','hydroxypropyl_methylcellulose_e464','FALSE','FALSE','Blocked / Exact Composition Required','WHO/JECFA chemical identity; viscosity/substitution grade and product composition not specified','2026-09-09','98','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','0','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','none_declared','TRUE','TRUE','TRUE','FALSE','ambient_dry','','IDENTITY REFERENCE for INS/E464 HPMC. Exact viscosity grade, substitution level, particle size, gelation temperature and carrier must be provided by the commercial TDS.','GC72 BLOCKED. JECFA confirms chemical identity and technological functions, not a universal food-grade composition or potency. No solids, PAC or stabilizer activity is assigned. Base/Engine remain FALSE until an exact grade/TDS and process model are selected.','https://apps.who.int/food-additives-contaminants-jecfa-database/Home/Chemical/2510','','Gellatti · GC67–GC75 closure','2026-09-09'),
('PI-ING-002563','microcrystalline_cellulose_mcc_e460i_grade_unspecified','MICROCRYSTALLINE CELLULOSE (MCC) · E460(i) · Grade Unspecified','Standard','Standard','General','','stabilizer','microcrystalline_cellulose_e460i','FALSE','FALSE','Blocked / Exact Composition Required','WHO/JECFA chemical identity; particle size/co-processing/carrier not specified','2026-09-09','98','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','0','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','none_declared','TRUE','TRUE','TRUE','FALSE','ambient_dry','','IDENTITY REFERENCE for microcrystalline cellulose / INS 460(i). Co-processed colloidal MCC systems containing CMC or other carriers are separate products.','GC72 BLOCKED. JECFA identity does not establish particle size, colloidal grade, carrier, water-binding potency or dispersion process. No universal composition or stabilizer activity is assigned; exact commercial TDS is mandatory.','https://apps.who.int/food-additives-contaminants-jecfa-database/Home/Chemical/281','','Gellatti · GC67–GC75 closure','2026-09-09'),
('PI-ING-002564','mono_diglycerides_fatty_acids_e471_origin_grade_unspecified','MONO- AND DIGLYCERIDES OF FATTY ACIDS · E471 · Origin / Grade Unspecified','Standard','Standard','General','','emulsifier','mono_diglycerides_fatty_acids_e471','FALSE','FALSE','Blocked / Exact Composition Required','WHO/JECFA chemical identity; monoester content, fatty-acid origin and carrier not specified','2026-09-09','98','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','0','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','','none_declared','FALSE','FALSE','TRUE','FALSE','ambient_dry','','IDENTITY REFERENCE for INS/E471 mixtures. Fatty-acid origin, mono-/diglyceride distribution, free glycerol, carrier and physical form determine suitability and performance.','GC72 BLOCKED. E471 is a family, not one composition. No fat, solids, PAC or emulsifier activity is assigned without an exact grade/TDS. Vegan and dairy-free suitability remain FALSE conservatively while fatty-acid origin is unspecified.','https://apps.who.int/food-additives-contaminants-jecfa-database/Home/Chemical/917','','Gellatti · GC67–GC75 closure','2026-09-09'),
('PI-ING-002565','global_buffalo_milk_raw_reference_6_89_fat','BUFFALO MILK · 6.89% FAT · 3.75% PROTEIN · Raw Reference','Standard','Standard','General','','dairy','buffalo_milk','TRUE','TRUE','Estimated / Source-based global reference','Compiled USDA nutrient table for raw buffalo milk; GC73 lactose/salt calculation','2026-09-09','91','83.39','16.61','6.89','4.597','6.89','9.72','3.75','0','5.18','5.18','0','0','0','0','5.18','0','0','0.13208','0','0.79','','','16.61','0.8288','5.952668','','0.008288','0.05952668','0','','','97','','','milk','FALSE','FALSE','TRUE','FALSE','refrigerated','','GLOBAL RAW BUFFALO-MILK COMPOSITION REFERENCE. Species-specific profile, not cow milk with a renamed label. Exact herd, season, standardisation, pasteurisation and product label override.','GC73 ENGINE-APPROVED COMPOSITION REFERENCE. Source values close exactly at 100 g. Carbohydrate/total sugars are modeled as lactose, consistent with the Mapper''s plain-milk convention. POD uses lactose sweetness 0.16; PAC uses lactose 1.0 plus sodium-derived salt. Composition eligibility does not permit raw-milk cold processing.','https://www.milkfacts.info/Nutrition%20Facts/Nutrient%20Content.htm','','Gellatti · GC67–GC75 closure','2026-09-09'),
('PI-ING-002566','leroux_soluble_chicory_nature_instant_powder','SOLUBLE CHICORY NATURE · Leroux · Instant Powder · 100% Chicory','Leroux','Leroux','France','','coffee_tea','instant_chicory_powder','TRUE','TRUE','Verified / Official Product Label / PI Calculated','Official Leroux Soluble Chicory Nature product page; GC74 balance/PAC calculation','2026-09-09','94','5','95','0.49','0.09','0','0','3','0','57','21','0','0','0','0','0','0','33','0.38','0','1.51','','','95','21','23.223','','0.21','0.23223','0','','','311','','','none_declared','TRUE','TRUE','TRUE','FALSE','ambient_dry','','EXACT LEROUX 100% SOLUBLE CHICORY POWDER. Distinct from PI-ING-000530 fresh/chilled chicory vegetable and from purified inulin. Use exact pack label if formulation changes.','GC74 ENGINE-APPROVED PRODUCT REFERENCE. Official label supplies fat, saturates, carbohydrate, sugars, fibre, protein, salt and energy. Water is an explicit 5% dry-powder model and ash 1.51% closes mass; these two fields are not laboratory values. Sugar species are unresolved, so aggregate sugars are treated as sucrose-equivalent for POD/PAC.','https://www.leroux.com/produits/chicoree-soluble-nature/','','Gellatti · GC67–GC75 closure','2026-09-09');
